# Build context for Dotnet_App/GadgetsOnline/Dockerfile. The context is the
# repository root, so everything below would otherwise be shipped to BuildKit and
# copied into the image by `COPY ./Dotnet_App/ .`.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS AppleDouble sidecars -- the reason this file exists
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS tar writes a `._<name>` companion for any file carrying extended
# attributes. Extracted on Linux those become real files, and `._Startup.cs`
# lands in the compiler's source list, which fails the build with
# "error CS2015: '...' is a binary file instead of a text file" -- once per
# source file, so 21 errors from a build that is otherwise fine.
._*
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
__MACOSX

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output. Restored and rebuilt inside the image; a host copy carries
# absolute paths from the machine that produced it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/publish/
**/*.user

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing here is needed to compile or run the application
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.claude/
aidlc/
doc/
CFN_Yaml/
CFN_Demo/
K8s_Yaml/
Jenkins_Config/
**/*.md
LICENSE.txt

# Python tooling for the diagrams
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
